<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "My_life_Without_Your_Love.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\元木町夕方の道.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Aah, it's hard being an exam student... 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm only going to Motoki High anyway, so the whole school doesn't need to go out of its way to hold supplementary classes..."<PG>
"Still... 
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
the days have gotten a lot shorter. 
{PAUSE ""}
This time of year it gets cold all at once, so it's the great enemy of staying healthy."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-173\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-173\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Oh, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>! What a coincidence!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Supplementary classes, by any chance?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah, it's really rough..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, it's only for now, so hang in there!"</STYLE><PG>
"Hmph, lucky you, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
Once you pass the high school exam, you get to say goodbye to exam studying..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"What are you talking about? On my very first day of high school, I got told, 'Only 1000 days left until the university entrance exams!'</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　High school exams and university exams seem to be on a whole different level after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"University exams, huh. I can't imagine that right now. 
{PAUSE ""}
How's high school life?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"How is it? I've told you so many times, haven't I? Only the school building and the uniform changed. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It just got a little closer to home, that's all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Supplementary classes just to change your uniform and school building... 
{PAUSE ""}
It doesn't seem worth it."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, high school exams are a road everyone walks!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Do your best, O exam student! Ha ha ha ha!"</STYLE><PG>
"Grrr... so this is a high schooler's composure... 
{PAUSE ""}
By the way, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>, why are you out this late?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? Oh, I just went to the hospital. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But today's Thursday, so it was closed."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The hospital? Are you sick somewhere?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"N-no... it's not like that, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You're not sick, but the hospital?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"U-um... well... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Ah! I just remembered something urgent! S-see you, </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "0" "10000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
"What's up with her... 
{PAUSE ""}
If she didn't know it was closed, does that mean today was her first time going to that hospital?
{PAUSE ""}
　But she seemed perfectly healthy. 
{PAUSE ""}
Ah... 
{PAUSE ""}
ah... 
{PAUSE ""}
ah..."<PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Achoo!!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
<PG>
"Sniff... it really is cold... 
{PAUSE ""}
If I catch a cold from worrying about <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> all the time, I'll be a real laughingstock. 
{PAUSE ""}
For an exam student, staying healthy is part of studying too, so I have to get it together!"
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
